==Battleground==
*1 [[Zamelle]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Mr. Mole]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 113.33~116.67 seconds<sup>3,400f~3,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**10 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
**10 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
