==Strategy==
This stage is actually somewhat simple and hinges on units with decently high DPS making it to the frail base so they can destroy it

A unit such as [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]] is a good option since it can fight the [[One Horn]] and moves decently fast, and the [[Zamelle]] doesn't have to be Z-killed as long as units make it past before it revives. Because 30 Zang Roos spawn after base hit, it must be destroyed as quickly as possible before they get to the Cat Base. [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is perfect for this job thanks to his very high damage.

